    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d729">

                <pb facs="0820" n="732" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg732"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Eddy.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-07-27"><hi rendition="#italic">July 27,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Adee instructs Mr. Eddy to ascertain whether the steamship <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Ardova</hi>, which was recently captured by the Russian
                    naval authorities in the Red Sea, has been released, and to advise the Russian
                        <pb facs="0821" n="733" xml:id="pg733"/> Government that the Government of
                    the United States owns part of the cargo, and that the explosives are consigned
                    to the insular government of the Philippine Islands.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
